  "stageId": "main_02-02",
  "title": "兵不接刃",
  "storyCode": "2-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5a0033d336c09cd8361dcd39778de394cf7aaf3dea9a7cef943b5c432c44bf70",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_o"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凱爾希醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏長官，羅德島的另外兩位代表也到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請坐。凱爾希小姐正向我說明現在的局勢呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就繼續吧。關於現在的局勢，我想魏先生也已經很清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門的情報網每天都在蒐集大量針對整合運動的資訊，想必也對這件事情極為重視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過僅憑這樣，龍門仍然還缺乏一些關鍵資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單的感染者檢疫是不能對抗整合運動的，想必龍門近衛局再清楚不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動不會乖乖過檢，更不會等到當局反應過來才行動。所以————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有羅德島的協助，龍門依靠目前對待感染者的策略，抵擋接下來整合運動的攻擊會面臨巨大損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我需要插一句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於龍門的防衛情報，龍門近衛局方面比羅德島更瞭解。對於整合運動的滲透，也已經做了相應準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是龍門目前沒有將相關機密行動的方針通知羅德島的義務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希小姐，請繼續說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門的確有對付手無寸鐵的感染者的經驗，但恐怕龍門目前沒有面對集團化感染者暴徒的經驗，這可能會讓龍門造成不必要的損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以羅德島目前的經驗來說————只有感染者，才能更好對抗感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，羅德島是否已經從針對整合運動的行動中獲得了有效的經驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "僅僅是有而已，大概是不敢自稱專家的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說，羅德島曾捲入過切爾諾伯格事件，並且從中也獲得了不少整合運動的其他情報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論魏先生是從哪裡得到這條消息的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這都不是現階段能與龍門交換的資訊。這只是履歷，只是站在這裡與魏先生交談的資格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "決定是否要和你們進行利益交換的是龍門。如果這種程度的資訊羅德島都無法提供的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門將無法信任你們的真實實力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏先生，我的言辭可能不夠清晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過需要強調的是——羅德島提供的資訊，本身就是用實力換來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但，無論怎樣，龍門都無法信任同樣是一群感染者的羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果陳小姐認為龍門的安危，尚不如對感染者進行盲目的懲罰來得重要————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我會立刻服從本地法令，任由陳小姐逮捕我，然後在監牢裡看著龍門被整合運動焚燒殆盡，默默惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次，龍門別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——龍門既不是因為有人出言不遜就拒絕善意的城市——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卻也不是收留無用說客的慈善機構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳警官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏長官，讓外來的感染者參與龍門的機密事務，我認為並不妥當。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷靜些，陳警官，他們是客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在他們違反龍門法律之前，我會容忍，長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不好意思。我想起來了，有這麼一句——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——沒錯，呣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所看重的就只有一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據我所知，羅德島也參與清剿了附近的感染者吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳警官，以目前確切瞭解的情報，羅德島在軍事力量的實力如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請容我簡要描述一下我所見的羅德島的行動情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——詳情如下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
